{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MassTheory.MayerThreeBodySign","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MassTheory.MayerThreeBodySign","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.MayerThreeBodySign.chi_typing_below_threshold","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.MayerThreeBodySign.chi_typing_below_threshold","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/MayerThreeBodySign.lean#L122-L126","doc":"The *largest* of the four `fpn` values the 2026-08-29 probe measured is the\nconvention-D `chi` typing, `fpn = z_D = 0.6126880371…`. It is below the\nthreshold, so every one of the four is. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.MayerThreeBodySign.b3_neg_of_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.MayerThreeBodySign.b3_neg_of_le","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/MayerThreeBodySign.lean#L115-L120","doc":"Contrapositive, in the form the measurement meets it: at or below the\nthreshold the cumulant is non-positive, and strictly negative once the bond\nproduct is strictly positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.MayerThreeBodySign.lt_of_b3_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.MayerThreeBodySign.lt_of_b3_pos","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/MayerThreeBodySign.lean#L107-L113","doc":"**A positive three-body cumulant requires `fpn > 2/3`** — for any edge set,\nany like-pair factors, and any energy scale. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.MayerThreeBodySign.b3_le_of_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.MayerThreeBodySign.b3_le_of_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/MayerThreeBodySign.lean#L101-L105","doc":"The product of bond factors is non-negative, so the three-body cumulant is\ncapped by a quantity depending on the **deuteron** factor alone. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.MayerThreeBodySign.b3_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.MayerThreeBodySign.b3_eq","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/MayerThreeBodySign.lean#L98-L99","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.MayerThreeBodySign.b3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.MayerThreeBodySign.b3","kind":"def","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/MayerThreeBodySign.lean#L93-L95","doc":"The connected three-body Ursell cumulant in `W`-units,\n`b₃ = W(3) − 3·b₂` with `W(3) = 1 − P₃`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.MayerThreeBodySign.b2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.MayerThreeBodySign.b2","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/MayerThreeBodySign.lean#L90-L91","doc":"The two-body Ursell cumulant in `W`-units: `b₂ = W(2) = 1 − fpn`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}